  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing Net-Zero Readiness of Vietnam Through Mobilizing Green Growth Investments</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Project Management. Project Steering Committee is set up and in operation, 2.Output 1. In-country acceleration program for the uptake of climate technologies, 3.Output 2. Development of a project pipeline along with 2 investment memoranda, 1 GCF concept note, and 1 GCF proposal, 4. Output 3. Development of climate and green growth policies focused on green investment mobilization</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to support Viet Nams goal of net zero emissions by 2050 by accelerating investments towards green start-ups and SMEs that will create direct climate impacts, and providing net zero policy interventions to strengthen the enabling environment for mobilizing climate finance&#x25A3; &#xAE30;&#xD6C4;&#xAE30;&#xC220;&#xC744; &#xBCF4;&#xC720;&#xD55C; &#xC2A4;&#xD0C0;&#xD2B8;&#xC5C5; &#xBC0F; &#xC911;&#xC18C;&#xAE30;&#xC5C5;&#xC758; &#xC561;&#xC140;&#xB7EC;&#xB808;&#xC774;&#xD130; &#xBC0F; &#xD22C;&#xC790;&#xC790; &#xC811;&#xADFC;&#xC131; &#xAC15;&#xD654;
&#x25A3; &#xC815;&#xBD80;&#xC758; &#xACF5;&#xACF5; &#xBC0F; &#xBBFC;&#xAC04; &#xB179;&#xC0C9;&#xD22C;&#xC790; &#xD65C;&#xC131;&#xD654; &#xC815;&#xCC45; &#xAC1C;&#xC120; &#xBC0F; &#xC131;(&#x7701;) &#xCC28;&#xC6D0;&#xC758; &#xC815;&#xCC45; &#xC774;&#xD589; &#xC900;&#xBE44; &#xAC15;&#xD654;</narrative>
